{"step_index":119,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-01T18:22:24Z","content":"**Rate limited!** Used 5/5 `get_geography_revenue` calls for today. But I got the profile, and this actually helps answer your FactTechz question. Let me build the report with what I have.","thinking":"Rate limited! 5/5 calls for get_geography_revenue used. I can't fetch the revenue data for Neon Man. Let me report what I have from the channel profile and note the rate limit.\n\nFrom the profile:\n- Channel ID: UCWZtQWpe1C2AksuJ5_eCMAQ\n- Title: Neon Man\n- Handle: @NeonMan\n- Subscribers: 2,410,000 (2.41M)\n- Total Views: 1,150,070,961 (1.15 BILLION)\n- Videos: 2,218\n- Country: India\n- Joined Apr 17, 2017 (~8.4 years), has email, links to Instagram/Twitter/Facebook, and describes itself as a Hindi news/drama/gossip commentary channel. Without the geography revenue data I'll have to rely on profile data plus general knowledge of Hindi news channel economics, which also reinforces the earlier point made about FactTechz's 45.8% figure from NexLev.\n\nActually, that number is probably a model-based estimate rather than real YouTube Analytics data, and likely misrepresents Hindi channels since their real audience is probably 70-85% India, 10-20% NRI diaspora in US/UK/Canada/Australia, and 5-10% Gulf-based Indian workers—NexLev's model may be skewed toward English-channel patterns. I'll present the Neon Man data along with a note about the rate limit and flag this geography concern for FactTechz too.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"NexLev audit of @NeonMan (profile only — RPM rate limited) plus critical analysis of NexLev's geographic data accuracy for Hindi channels. Addresses user's valid question about why FactTechz supposedly has 45.8% US traffic. Concludes NexLev uses modeled/estimated demographics, not actual YouTube Analytics, and likely overestimates Tier 1 traffic for Hindi channels by 2-3x. Real FactTechz RPM is probably $0.50-1.50 rather than $4.31.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# @NeonMan (Neon Man) — NexLev Channel Audit\\n\\n> **Date**: September 1, 2026\\n> **Status**: Profile ✅ | Revenue ❌ (rate limited 5/5 for today)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Channel Profile (NexLev Data)\\n\\n| Field | Value |\\n|-------|-------|\\n| **Channel Name** | Neon Man ✅ (Verified) |\\n| **Handle** | @NeonMan |\\n| **Channel ID** | `UCWZtQWpe1C2AksuJ5_eCMAQ` |\\n| **Country** | India |\\n| **Joined** | Apr 17, 2017 (**~8.4 years / 101 months**) |\\n| **Subscribers** | **2,410,000 (2.41M)** |\\n| **Total Views** | **1,150,070,961 (1.15 BILLION)** |\\n| **Videos** | 2,218 |\\n| **Has Shorts** | Not confirmed |\\n| **Has Contact Email** | Yes |\\n| **Social Links** | Instagram, Twitter, Facebook, Submit News (Google Form) |\\n| **Description** | \\\"Welcome to India's #1 YouTube News Channel!\\\" |\\n| **Content Style** | Hindi news commentary, drama/controversy coverage, celebrity gossip — Samay Raina, India's Got Latent, Dhanda Nyoliwala |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. RPM & Revenue — ❌ RATE LIMITED\\n\\n> [!WARNING]\\n> **`get_geography_revenue` rate limit reached (5/5 for today).** Cannot fetch RPM, revenue, or demographics for Neon Man. Will be available again tomorrow.\\n\\n### Estimated Revenue (Based on Similar Hindi Channels)\\n\\nSince Neon Man is a **Hindi news/commentary** channel based in India, here's a realistic estimate:\\n\\n| Metric | Estimated Value | Basis |\\n|--------|----------------|-------|\\n| **Category RPM (Hindi news)** | ~\\\\$0.30-0.80 | Indian Hindi channels get very low RPM |\\n| **Monthly Views (estimated)** | ~10-20M | Based on recent video views (81K-533K per video) |\\n| **Monthly Revenue** | **~\\\\$3,000-16,000** | Very rough estimate |\\n\\n> I'll run the actual NexLev revenue check tomorrow when the rate limit resets.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Key Videos (From Screenshot)\\n\\n| Title | Views | Age |\\n|-------|-------|-----|\\n| You Won't BELIEVE Why She DID This... REQUEST To Samay Raina 🙏 Toxic | 81K | 2 hours |\\n| MOST UNEXPECTED COMEBACK! Chaar Diwari Vs Dhanda Nyoliwala | 512K | 1 day |\\n| AGAIN?! Samay Raina & Latent vs P\n<truncated 5294 bytes>","Description":"\"NeonMan audit (profile only, RPM rate limited) plus critical analysis exposing NexLev's likely inaccurate geographic data for Hindi channels.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\renu5\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\ef440df2-a098-44c4-b54d-aa1af299148e\\\\NeonMan_analysis.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating audit report\"","toolSummary":"\"NeonMan analysis\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
