{"step_index":141,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-01T18:35:52Z","content":"New account worked! Got the data. And look — **your suspicion is confirmed AGAIN**:\n\n**NeonMan (pure Hindi gossip about Samay Raina) shows 40.3% US traffic.** That's clearly wrong. Let me update the report.","thinking":"New auth worked! Got the NeonMan data. Let me analyze:\n\n**NeonMan Revenue Data:**\n- Channel Type: LONG_ONLY (interesting - no shorts counted)\n- Category: internet controversies\n- Category RPM: $2.00\n- Channel Long RPM: $1.72\n- Monthly Revenue: $15,144\n- Monthly Long Revenue: $15,144\n- Monthly Short Revenue: $0\n- Monthly Long Views: 8,790,616 (8.8M)\n- Short Views: 0\n- Avg Duration: 792.8 seconds = ~13:13\n- Language: eng (again classified as English even though it's Hindi)\nDemographics skew heavily male (79.5%) and young (18-24 at 39.3%). The country breakdown shows the exact same pattern I keep seeing: US 40.3%, India 22.7%, UK 13.9%, Australia 13.6%, Canada 9.5% - this recurring geographic distribution across channels is worth noting.\n\nBut this is a Hindi-language gossip channel covering Indian celebrities - there's no realistic way 40% of viewers are American. This strongly confirms my suspicion that NexLev is applying a templated geographic model rather than real data. The RPM and revenue figures might still hold some value, but any derived lifetime earnings calculation using this fake geographic split would be unreliable, especially if actual India traffic is much higher than reported.\n\nThat tracks - a young audience drawn to internet drama and gossip content. Now let me incorporate this new data into the NeonMan analysis.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Complete NexLev audit of @NeonMan with fresh auth. $15,144/month, $1.72 RPM, 8.8M monthly views. Hindi internet drama/gossip channel. Geographic data again shows 40.3% US for a pure Hindi channel — further confirming NexLev uses templated geographic estimates. Young audience (48.3% under 25). Includes lifetime earnings calculation and comparison with FactTechz.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# @NeonMan (Neon Man) — Full NexLev Channel Audit\\n\\n> **All data sourced from NexLev MCP — zero assumptions.**\\n> **Date**: September 2, 2026 (fresh auth — new account)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Channel Profile\\n\\n| Field | Value |\\n|-------|-------|\\n| **Channel Name** | Neon Man ✅ (Verified) |\\n| **Handle** | @NeonMan |\\n| **Channel ID** | `UCWZtQWpe1C2AksuJ5_eCMAQ` |\\n| **Country** | India |\\n| **Joined** | Apr 17, 2017 (**~8.4 years / 101 months**) |\\n| **Subscribers** | **2,410,000 (2.41M)** |\\n| **Total Views** | **1,150,070,961 (1.15 BILLION)** |\\n| **Videos** | 2,218 |\\n| **Avg Video Duration** | ~13:13 (793 seconds) |\\n| **Family Safe** | Yes |\\n| **Has Contact Email** | Yes |\\n| **NexLev Category** | **internet controversies** |\\n| **Content Style** | Hindi news/drama/gossip — Samay Raina, India's Got Latent, Dhanda Nyoliwala, politician lafda |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. RPM & Revenue\\n\\n| Metric | Value |\\n|--------|-------|\\n| **Category RPM** | **\\\\$2.00** |\\n| **Channel Long-form RPM** | **\\\\$1.72** |\\n| **Estimated Monthly Revenue** | **\\\\$15,144** |\\n| **Monthly Long-form Revenue** | \\\\$15,144 |\\n| **Monthly Long-form Views** | 8,790,616 (8.8M) |\\n| **Channel Type** | LONG_ONLY |\\n| **Channel Language** | English (NexLev classification — actually Hindi) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Total Lifetime Earnings\\n\\n| Calculation | Value |\\n|------------|-------|\\n| Total views | 1,150,070,961 (1.15B) |\\n| Channel RPM | \\\\$1.72 |\\n| **Estimated total lifetime earnings** | **~\\\\$1,978,122 (~\\\\$2M)** |\\n| Channel age | ~101 months (~8.4 years) |\\n| **Average monthly earning (lifetime)** | **~\\\\$19,585/month** |\\n| **Current monthly earning** | **\\\\$15,144/month** |\\n| **Per year (current rate)** | **\\\\$181,728/year** |\\n| **Per year (lifetime avg)** | **\\\\$234,776/year** |\\n| **Revenue per video** | **\\\\$892** |\\n| **Views per video** | **518,517** |\\n\\n> [!NOTE]\\n> 📉 **Channel is slightly DECLINING** — Current monthly (\\\\$15,144) is below lifetime average (\\\\$19,585). This could be seasonal, or the drama/gossip niche \n<truncated 4374 bytes>","Description":"\"Complete NeonMan audit with fresh NexLev auth, including proof that NexLev's geographic data is templated for Hindi channels.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\renu5\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\ef440df2-a098-44c4-b54d-aa1af299148e\\\\NeonMan_analysis.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating audit report\"","toolSummary":"\"NeonMan full analysis\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
