{"step_index":166,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-01T19:42:42Z","content":"Here is the exact list of analytics, metrics, and calculations that our NexLev audit performs. You can copy-paste this list directly into vidIQ or an AI tool as the strict criteria for what it needs to analyze.\n\n### The NexLev Channel Audit Framework (Data Points to Extract & Calculate)\n\n**1. Core Channel Profile Analytics**\n*   Channel Name & Handle\n*   Channel Creation Date (Calculate exact age in months)\n*   Total Lifetime Views\n*   Total Subscriber Count\n*   Total Videos Published\n*   Channel Type Classification (Long-Form Only, Shorts Only, or Mixed)\n*   Primary Niche / Category\n\n**2. Revenue & RPM Analytics (Separating Long vs. Short)**\n*   Overall Category Average RPM\n*   Specific Channel Long-Form RPM\n*   Specific Channel Shorts RPM (if applicable)\n*   30-Day Long-Form Views vs. 30-Day Shorts Views (Split percentage)\n*   Estimated 30-Day Long-Form Revenue\n*   Estimated 30-Day Shorts Revenue\n*   Total Estimated 30-Day Revenue\n\n**3. Derived Efficiency & Lifetime Calculations (The Math)**\n*   **Total Lifetime Earnings Estimate:** (Total Lifetime Views / 1000) * Channel Long-Form RPM\n*   **Historical Monthly Average:** Total Lifetime Earnings / Channel Age (in months)\n*   **Growth Signal:** Compare \"Historical Monthly Average\" vs. \"Estimated 30-Day Revenue\" (Is it currently growing or declining?)\n*   **Revenue Per Video:** Total Lifetime Earnings / Total Videos Published\n*   **Views Per Video:** Total Lifetime Views / Total Videos Published\n\n**4. Audience Demographic Analytics**\n*   Gender Split Percentages (Male / Female)\n*   Age Distribution Breakdown (13-17, 18-24, 25-34, 35-44, 45-54, 55-64, 65+)\n*   Top 5 Viewership Countries (by percentage)\n*   **Tier 1 Traffic Score:** Combined percentage of views from US + UK + Canada + Australia\n\n**5. Velocity & Content Analytics**\n*   Average Video Duration (in minutes/seconds)\n*   Upload Frequency (Videos per week/month)\n*   Current VPH (Views Per Hour) of the 3 most recent videos\n*   Breakout Score (Identifying which specific videos are pulling the majority of the 30-day view volume)","thinking":"**Defining the Goal**\n\nOkay, I'm working on clarifying the user's intent. It seems they are not after a simple chat bot prompt, but a detailed breakdown of NexLev's analytical metrics and tasks, specifically those identified during our audits. I need to make sure I am focused on the right thing.\n\n\n**Clarifying the Focus**\n\nI've got a much clearer picture. The core goal is translating our NexLev audit process into a format vidIQ can use. I'm breaking down the audit's key components: profile data, revenue metrics like RPM, and calculations for lifetime earnings, along with demographic insights. It's about distilling our methodology for vidIQ's use, so it can replicate our in-depth channel analysis.\n\n\n"}
